On Thu, Oct 15, 2026 at 11:01=E2=80=AFAM Ken Kubota <ietf@kenkubota.de> wro=
te:

>
> 1. Why is former NSA lifetime employee Deb Cooley, now serving as Securit=
y
> Area Director, forcing through a document [1] that deflects Professor
> Bernstein's concerns [2]?


Perhaps because Dr. Bersteins concerns have been heard and found not to
have consensus.  Honest people can disagree, and we all lose sometimes.
Not everything is a conspiracy.

I would really love it if we could quit relitigating this stuff in
increasingly innuendo-filled ways on this list.  Chairs, some moderation?

--Richard

--0000000000001dfff6065de312ad
